---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import coffee from '../assets/coffee.png';
---

<section class="reveal mb-16">
	<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-10">
		<Image
			src={coffee}
			alt=""
			class="doodle-image w-28 shrink-0 md:w-32 lg:w-36"
			width={160}
			height={160}
		/>
		<div class="max-w-prose space-y-4">
			<p>
				Over the last decade I've built web applications, design systems, developer platforms,
				and AI-enabled products. Along the way I've become increasingly interested in a different
				set of questions:
			</p>
			<ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-2 pl-2">
				<li>How do systems shape human behavior?</li>
				<li>Why do some communities thrive while others struggle?</li>
				<li>What kinds of work help people flourish?</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Those questions show up everywhere—in software teams, workplaces, churches, neighborhoods,
				families, and the technologies we build.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is a home for my writing and projects. You'll find essays about technology and
				society, notes on engineering leadership, experiments in making things by hand, and
				occasional reflections on parenthood, community, and the messy process of figuring out how
				to live well.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
